// Embeds the app icon into netvis.exe. Icon ID 1 is the lowest numeric
// ID, which is what Windows Explorer uses as the file's display icon, and
// what the app loads at runtime for its window/taskbar/tray icon.
1 ICON "netvis.ico"

// The UAC + DPI manifest. Resource ID 1 of type RT_MANIFEST (24) is the
// one Windows reads when starting the process. It's embedded here rather
// than generated by the linker so the same file is used whichever
// toolchain builds netvis.
1 24 "netvis.manifest"
